AfriEstate Flights — End-to-End UI/UX Design
The AfriEstate flight experience should take the best metasearch principles from Wego and turn them into an Africa-first flight booking operating system.

The core journey is:

Discover → Search → Compare → Filter → Select → Review → Traveller Details → Add-ons → Payment → Confirmation → Manage Trip

The design should feel premium, trustworthy, fast, African, and highly conversion-focused.
1. Product Positioning
AfriEstate Flights
Primary proposition:
Find the best flights across Africa and the world — compare, book and manage your entire journey in one place.

Supporting value propositions
- Compare airlines and travel providers
- Transparent total prices
- African and international routes
- Local currencies
- Local payment methods
- Visa and entry information
- Flexible-date search
- AI travel assistance
- Flight alerts
- Complete digital itinerary
- Hotels and experiences after booking
