55. Final AfriEstate Flight Product
The finished product should therefore feel less like a traditional airline website and more like a premium African travel marketplace.

The central philosophy should be:
Search globally. Understand locally. Book confidently. Travel Africa.

The most important differentiators versus a simple Wego recreation should be:

1. Africa-first flight inventory

2. African currency and payment intelligence

3. Visa and entry intelligence

4. AI-powered flight recommendations

5. Flexible-date and "Anywhere in Africa" discovery

6. WhatsApp booking and travel notifications

7. Flight + hotel + transfer cross-selling

8. One unified My Trip

9. Transparent all-in pricing

10. End-to-end post-booking travel assistance

This gives AfriEstate a complete flight-booking product from first search through payment, ticketing, travel management and post-booking support, rather than merely reproducing Wego's visual interface.